## $\chi^2$ Test of Goodness of Fit Cutoffs

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="50%"}
Cutoff for test of heads vs. tails

<br>

::: fragment
$J =$ 2

$\text{df} = J - 1 =$ 1
:::

::: fragment

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
qchisq(.95, 1)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 3.841459
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
qchisq(.05, 1, lower.tail = F)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 3.841459
```


:::
:::

:::
:::

::: {.column width="50%"}
Cutoff for test of favorite color in the rainbow

::: fragment
$J =$ 7 (ROYGBIV)

$\text{df} = J - 1 =$ 6
:::

::: fragment

::: {.cell}

