## $\chi^2$ Test of Independence R Function

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="60%"}

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-line-numbers="false"}
studdat <- data.frame(type = c("Undergrad", "Graduate"),
           `In-State` = c(25, 5),
           `Out-of-State` = c(10, 10))
studdat |>
  select(-type) |>
  chisq.test(correct = F)
```

