```

	Pearson's Chi-squared test

data:  select(studdat, -type)
X-squared = 6.3492, df = 1, p-value = 0.01174
```


:::
:::

:::

::: {.column width="40%"}
[○ `correct` = [`T`/`F`], applies a "continuity correction" to the $\chi^2$ value. Default is `T`. Change to `F`!]{.subpoint}
:::
::::

