An [independent samples / repeated measures] *t*-test analysis was conducted between [group 1] and [group 2]. We [[fail to reject]{.blue} / [reject]{.gold}] H0 [[in favor of H1]{.gold}], *t*([df]) = [____], *p* [[< 0.05]{.gold} / [p-value]{.blue}]. We [[did not]{.blue}] observe[[d]{.gold}] a significant difference between the mean [DV] of [group 1] and [group 2] in our sample.




